ry/environment.md` (Brokered SAML) |\n| `object-store` | S3-compatible object store for evidence | `not_verified` | Mobily IT | Endpoint (https), region, a private bucket, an optional key prefix, a least-privilege access key pair as secret references, and the CA if it is corporate | `docs/delivery/environment.md` (IT object store (S3-compatible)) |\n| `smtp-relay` | SMTP relay for the email channel | `not_verified` | Mobily IT | Relay host and port, security mode, optional credentials as secret references, sender address, and the CA if it is corporate | `docs/delivery/environment.md` (SMTP relay) |\n| `enterprise-messaging` | Enterprise messaging channel (no adapter ships in this release) | `not_configured` | Mobily IT | Nothing in this release (no adapter ships) | `docs/delivery/environment.md` (Enterprise messaging) |\n| `corporate-data-source` | Corporate data source for the http_pull connector | `not_verified` | Mobily IT | The source endpoint (https), its credential as a secret reference, the field mapping, and the network route | `docs/delivery/environment.md` (Corporate data source (`http_pull` connector)) |\n| `ai-endpoint` | IT-hosted AI model endpoint for the optional assistant (off by default) | `not_configured` | Mobily IT | The endpoint, model name and credential reference of an IT-approved provider, if Mobily chooses to enable the assistant | `docs/delivery/environment.md` (AI model endpoint (optional assistant)) |\n| `package-registry` | Live package and image registry or IT mirror for builds and image pulls | `not_verified` | Mobily IT | An internal npm registry or mirror for the offline build, and an image registry or mirror for the images of `deploy/images.lock.json` | D-057 |\n| `live-ci` | Live CI execution of deploy/ci/ci.yml | `not_verified` | Mobily IT | A CI runner for `deploy/ci/ci.yml` (copied to `.github/workflows/ci.yml`) | D-058 |\n| `orchestration-target` | Deployment configuration for Mobily's orchestration platform | `not_configured` | Mobily IT | The name of the target orchestration platform. Deployment configuration for Mobily's orchestration platform is to be written when IT names the target. This release ships no such configuration. | D-243 Q12 |\n\nEvery dependency above: Not verified in this release. Mobily IT must supply and test it. The same list is `external-dependencies.json`, which the About screen and the release notes read.\n\nSign-in has been tested only with a synthetic identity provider. Connecting the corporate identity provider is an external dependency.\n<!-- generated:external-dependencies end -->\n\n## 2. Protocol-audit disclosure {#protocol-audit}\n\n<!-- generated:protocol-audit begin -->\nReport: `tools/release/protocol-audit.mjs` 1.0.0, repository head `119dcd0541b1e8351e23c233d62cc3d25f9ed794`, SHA-256 `2614fc6ce028523bacb197db700bfd2c42aa7d5ef3f2dabdee40271560c2f3fd`, stages DG0, DG1, DG2, DG3, DG4, DG5, DG6, DG7.\n\nThe delivery records of gates DG0–DG6 contain the historic protocol observations listed below, found by the protocol audit. None changed product behaviour. They are disclosed here, and no gate was reopened (decision D-249).\n\n| Check | Requirement | Stage | Result | Hits | Disclosure |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| C1 concurrency | REQ-DLV-009 | DG5 | HIT | 2 | D-249 H1 |\n| C1 concurrency | REQ-DLV-009 | DG6 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H2 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG0 | HIT | 49 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG1 | HIT | 16 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG2 | HIT | 39 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG3 | HIT | 14 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG4 | HIT | 11 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG5 | HIT | 6 | D-249 H3 |\n| C2 assignment-contract | REQ-DLV-011 | DG6 | HIT | 14 | D-249 H3, H4 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG2 | HIT | 8 | D-249 H5 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG3 | HIT | 3 | D-249 H5 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG4 | HIT | 4 | D-249 H5 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG5 | HIT | 20 | D-249 H5 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG6 | HIT | 13 | D-249 H5 |\n| C3 handback-sections | REQ-DLV-012 | DG7 | HIT | 1 | not in D-249 (DG7: disclosed by this release's records) |\n| C4 file-ownership | REQ-DLV-008 | DG4 | HIT | 24 | D-249 H6 |\n| C4 file-ownership | REQ-DLV-008 | DG5 | HIT | 8 | D-249 H7 |\n| C4 file-ownership | REQ-DLV-008 | DG6 | HIT | 5 | D-249 H7 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG1 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG2 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG3 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG4 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG5 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG6 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H8 |\n| C5 historical-first | REQ-DLV-024 | DG7 | HIT | 1 | not in D-249 (DG7: disclosed by this release's records) |\n| C6 progress-updates | REQ-DLV-028; REQ-DLV-012 | DG0 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H9 |\n| C6 progress-updates | REQ-DLV-028; REQ-DLV-012 | DG6 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H10 |\n| C7 three-failed-fixes | REQ-DLV-018 | DG3 | HIT | 1 | D-249 H11 |\n\nAccepted observations reported by the audit:\n\n- C9 stage-continuation, DG0: history-out-of-order, reported as the accepted observation F-DG6-952 (not a new hit; the approved history is not rewritten).\n- C9 stage-continuation, DG5: history-out-of-order, reported as the accepted observation F-DG6-952 (not a new hit; the approved history is not rewritten).\n<!-- generated:protocol-audit end -->\n\n## 3. Provisional Arabic {#provisional-arabic}\n\n<!-- generated:provisional-arabic begin -->\n| Provisional Arabic UI label file | Entries |\n| --- | --- |\n| `apps/web/src/i18n/provisional-ar-p6.ts` | 79 |\n| `apps/web/src/i18n/provisional-ar-p7-release.ts` | 67 |\n| `apps/web/src/i18n/provisional-ar-p7-transfer.ts` | 35 |\n| `apps/web/src/i